    "text": "The real solutions of the equation <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mn>-1&nbsp;</mn> </msup> <msqrt> <mtext>x</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </msqrt> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>sin</mtext> <mn>-1&nbsp;</mn> </msup> <msqrt> <msup> <mtext>x</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo> <mtext>x</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mn>1</mn> </msqrt> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn>&nbsp;</mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> are"
